# Global API Keys
# ================
# Template for baking LLM provider credentials into the Docker image.
#
# Usage:
#   1. Copy this file to 'global.env' in the same directory
#   2. Uncomment and fill in the keys you need
#   3. Rebuild the image: make build
#
# Keys set here apply to every agent by default.
# Individual agents can override them — see manage-api-keys.sh.
#
# Security:
#   - Do NOT commit global.env to version control
#   - Inside the container, key files are root-owned, mode 600
#   - Agents can read their own keys but cannot modify them

# ── Anthropic (Claude) ───────────────────────────────────────────────
#ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# ── OpenAI ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...

# ── Google / Gemini ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
#GOOGLE_API_KEY=...
#GEMINI_API_KEY=...

# ── Mistral ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#MISTRAL_API_KEY=...

# ── Cohere ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#COHERE_API_KEY=...

# ── Groq ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#GROQ_API_KEY=gsk_...

# ── Together.ai ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#TOGETHER_API_KEY=...

# ── Fireworks.ai ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#FIREWORKS_API_KEY=...

# ── Perplexity ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#PERPLEXITY_API_KEY=pplx-...

# ── Replicate ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#REPLICATE_API_TOKEN=r8_...

# ── Hugging Face ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#HUGGINGFACE_API_KEY=hf_...
#HF_TOKEN=hf_...

# ── AWS Bedrock ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID=...
#AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=...
#AWS_DEFAULT_REGION=us-east-1

# ── Azure OpenAI ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#AZURE_OPENAI_API_KEY=...
#AZURE_OPENAI_ENDPOINT=https://your-resource.openai.azure.com/

# ── GitHub ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Used by git for HTTPS authentication and by the gh CLI.
# GH_TOKEN takes precedence over GITHUB_TOKEN — only one is needed.
#GITHUB_TOKEN=ghp_...
#GH_TOKEN=ghp_...

# ── Custom / Other ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Add additional keys below using the format: VARIABLE_NAME=value
